                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈMES ET PROCÉDÉS D'INTERACTION LOCALE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">LOCAL INTERACTION SYSTEMS AND METHODS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An interactive attraction system, comprising: a first interaction point (216A) configured to: receive an interaction with a wearable device (14), wherein the interaction includes a data transmission between the wearable device (14) and the first interaction point (216A) indicating that a user has interacted with the first interaction point (216A); locally process the interaction between the wearable device (14) and the first interaction point (216A); and provide information based on the local processing to a second interaction point (216B).</p>
            </abstract>
